# System Architecture

## Overview

The system is divided into five major sections:

```text
                   +----------------+
                   | User Interface |
                   | Buttons/Switch |
                   +-------+--------+
                           |
                           v
                   +---------------+
                   | Command Logic |
                   +-------+-------+
                           |
                           v
                   +---------------+
                   |   APB Master  |
                   +-------+-------+
                           |
                    APB-style bus
                           |
             +-------------+-------------+
             |                           |
             v                           v
      +-------------+             +-------------+
      | FIFO Slave  |             | PWM Slave   |
      +------+------+             +------+------+
             |                           |
             v                           v
      +-------------+             +-------------+
      | FIFO        |             | PWM Output  |
      +------+------+             +-------------+
             |
             v
      +-------------+
      | FIFO Timer  |
      +------+------+
             |
             v
      +-------------+
      | 7-Segment   |
      +-------------+
```

## Data Flow

A FIFO write begins with a button press.

```text
Switches
   ↓
Button debounce
   ↓
Edge detector
   ↓
Command generator
   ↓
APB master
   ↓
FIFO APB slave
   ↓
FIFO
```

At the same time, the FIFO write command starts the elapsed timer.

```text
FIFO WRITE
    ↓
Timer reset
    ↓
Timer starts counting
```

A FIFO read performs the reverse operation:

```text
BTNC
 ↓
APB READ
 ↓
FIFO
 ↓
FIFO DATA OUT
 ↓
Display
```

The read command also stops the timer.

## Main Timing Relationship

```text
WRITE                         READ
  |                             |
  v                             v
+---+---------------------------+---+
|       elapsed-time interval       |
+-----------------------------------+
  |<----------- timer ------------->|
```

The timer therefore measures the interval between the two FIFO events.
